  "body": "Welcome to 5B Piripiri Crescent, nestled in the highly sought-after suburb of Torbay. This charming 523 sqm section is an exceptional find, ideal for developers, family house builders, or investors looking for a project with substantial potential. The Pine Tree in the photos has now been removed! \r\n\r\nSet within a residential zone, this property offers a peaceful and private environment, perfect for those seeking a serene lifestyle. The price guide of $699,000 reflects outstanding value for this prime location and its promising features.\r\n\r\nConveniently located near transport links, shops, and top-rated schools, this section is a practical and appealing choice for a range of buyers.\r\n\r\nDon't miss out on this fantastic opportunity to secure a piece of Torbay's desirable real estate. Contact us today to arrange a viewing or for more information.",
